# Overlay: the CF2X square flown as SPLINE legs (the same four points as params/cf2x.params; a file
# with WAYPOINT or SPLINE lines replaces the mission). Each corner is passed at speed on a curve
# through the waypoint. Load after the vehicle file:
# --params params/cf2x.params --params params/cf2x-spline.params
SPLINE  1  0  -1.0
SPLINE  1  1  -1.5
SPLINE  0  1  -1.5
SPLINE  0  0  -1.0
